WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sn.

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:09.970
Vhidhiyo iyi inopa sumo pfupi kumudziyo weArclight.

2
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:18.220
Kana yangobatanidzwa, iyo sideshole yeiyo yakananga ophthalmoscope ichaiswa zvakananga pamusoro peiyo

3
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:26.469
pakati pe lens iyo nharembozha yako inoshandisa muvhidhiyo modhi.

4
00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:31.051
Iyo kamera ichashanda semeso ako

5
00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:35.634
paunenge wakatarisa nepaburi repadivi.

6
00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:40.217
Kuti usimbise kuti ndeipi lenzi yekumisikidza iyo

7
00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:44.800
sidehole ne, vhura vhidhiyo app, kana

8
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:45.653
foni yako.

9
00:00:45.653 --> 00:00:49.067
Isa chigunwe chako pamusoro pe lens imwe neimwe.

10
00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.480
Kana iyo skrini yasviba, iwe wakavhara

11
00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.660
iyo lens inoshandiswa kuvhidhiyo.

12
00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:59.020
Bvisa bepa reyero kubva kumashure kweklipu.

13
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.200
Isa pfungwa dze

14
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.387
museve pamusoro pepakati lenzi rinoshandiswa kutora vhidhiyo.

15
00:01:06.387 --> 00:01:08.745
Dzvanya clip pasi zvakasimba.

16
00:01:08.745 --> 00:01:10.160
Bvisa museve.

17
00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.156
clip yacho inofanira kunge iri panzvimbo chaiyo.

18
00:01:14.156 --> 00:01:16.820
Kuti vhidhiyo reflex switch on

19
00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:22.300
iyo barectophthalboscope, pedza mwenje wekuita uye sarudza iyo inopenya zvakanyanya

20
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.455
nekudzvanya katatu.

21
00:01:23.455 --> 00:01:26.920
Ita shuwa kuti lens rack iri kumusoro.

22
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.460
Nechiedza chakatarisana

23
00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.180
kure nefoni yakananga kumurwere, isa mwenje wechiitiko mu clip uye dhonza

24
00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.018
dhonza elastic pamusoro kuti uchengetedze.

25
00:01:37.018 --> 00:01:42.220
Sundidzira maarc mwenje kumusoro kusvika isingakwanise kutsvedza zvakare.

26
00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:47.407
Iyo slide buri reiyo yakananga yeoscilloscope ichave yakananga pamusoro

27
00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.260
pakati pe lenzi

28
00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.541
iyo inotora vhidhiyo.

29
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:55.666
Kunyora ziso rekunze, shandisa imwe mugumo wemudziyo.

30
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:56.520
Kubata

31
00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:02.976
mufananidzo izvozvi, vhura iyo vhidhiyo app uye zoom mukuzadza iyo skrini neiyo

32
00:02:02.976 --> 00:02:04.360
kuona kuburikidza ne

33
00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:05.240
kumba kwenzvimbo.

34
00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.880
Dzvanya rekodhi uye ita bvunzo.

35
00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.520
Dzvanya mira uye chengetedza vhidhiyo.

36
00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:17.640
Iwe unogona ikozvino kugovana nevamwe vaunoshanda navo pane akachengeteka encrypted mapuratifomu chete nechinangwa chako

37
00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:29.460
kuwana pfungwa kubva kuvarwere.

38
00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:45.220
Nakidzwa nekushandisa mwenje wekuita pabasa rangu.
